OL,3,A'Gromit was nearly a cat!': Secrets
OL,4,Afrom 50 years of Aardman
OL,5,
OL,6,FGromit was almost a cat. Shaun the
OL,7,FSheep was nearly given a voice. And
OL,8,FChicken Run helped change the Oscars
OL,9,Fforever.
OL,11,FAs Aardman Animations marks its 50th
OL,12,Fbirthday, its creators have been
OL,13,Fsharing some of the surprising twists
OL,14,Fbehind the rise of Bristol's best-known
OL,15,Fcreative success story.
OL,17,FFounded by school friends Sir Peter
OL,18,FLord and Sir David Sproxton in 1976,
OL,19,FAardman has given us Morph, Wallace and
OL,20,FGromit, Shaun the Sheep and Chicken
OL,21,FRun, the world's most successful
OL,22,Fstop-motion film.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
