OL,3,A'Gromit was nearly a cat!': Secrets
OL,4,Afrom 50 years of Aardman
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the journey from two teenagers
OL,7,F"mucking about with plasticine" to an
OL,8,FOscar-winning animation powerhouse has
OL,9,Foften hinged on chance decisions,
OL,10,Fpractical compromises and creative
OL,11,Finstinct.
